erson":"zhou-yu","role":"随征","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o003b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"统军","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o003b-q"]},{"person":"cheng-pu","role":"皆有功、增兵二千骑五十匹","evidence":["chenghuang-q-77ea8315d8b6d9b27bac"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0046","role":"被破","evidence":["chenghuang-q-77ea8315d8b6d9b27bac"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0045","role":"被破","evidence":["chenghuang-q-77ea8315d8b6d9b27bac"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"孙策东渡时","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhouyu-e-o003b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhouyu-e-o003b-q","source_order":[54,4,"O003b"],"order":9563},{"id":"zhulv-e2-fan-hengjiang","title":"吕范东渡横江当利，破张英于麋","accounts":[{"id":"zhulv-a2-b142a4c43a8f792cd3c2","label":"正文","text":"吕范东渡横江当利，破张英于麋","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0157","role":"从征者","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]},{"person":"wudi-p0099","role":"率军者","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0046","role":"被破者","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]},{"person":"sunshi-p0045","role":"被破者","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8","order":10003}],"persons":[{"id":"sunshi-p0045","name":"于麋","evidence":["sunshi-q-o027","chenghuang-q-77ea8315d8b6d9b27bac","zhulv-q-404bf8a47a0d895284ae","zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"sunshi-m-o027-sunshi-p0045","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-o027"]},{"id":"sunshi-m-p037-sunshi-p0045","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-p037"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chenghuang-q-77ea8315d8b6d9b27bac","section":"chapter-055","block":"b-5ecb4d52b1b6c18777c8","layer":"original","quote":"策到横江、当利，破张英、于麋等，转下秣陵、湖孰、句容、曲阿，普皆有功；增兵二千，骑五十匹","section_title":"程黄韩蒋周陈董甘凌徐潘丁传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0117.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-o027b-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-1538e7ae2754e5a06f87","layer":"original","quote":"繇遣樊能、于麋（陈横屯江津）〔屯横江〕〖23〗，张英屯当利口〖24〗，以拒术。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":81,"end":120,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-e-p037e-q","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-8ad4a2f852325dd4ff74","layer":"pei","quote":"而樊能、于麋等，复合众，袭夺牛渚屯。策闻之，还攻破能等，获男女万余人。","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fa39d8ee05c62716a11","start":106,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-o027","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-1538e7ae2754e5a06f87","layer":"original","quote":"先是，刘繇为扬州刺史〖20〗，州旧治寿春。寿春，术已据之；繇乃渡江，治曲阿。时吴景尚在丹杨，策从兄贲又为丹杨都尉〖21〗；繇至，皆迫逐之。景、贲退舍历阳〖22〗。繇遣樊能、于麋（陈横屯江津）〔屯横江〕〖23〗，张英屯当利口〖24〗，以拒术。术自用故吏琅邪惠衢为扬州刺史〖25〗，更以景为督军中郎将〖26〗；与贲共将兵击英等，连年不克。","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":179,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":167,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p037","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-8ad4a2f852325dd4ff74","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《江表传》曰：“策渡江，攻繇牛渚营，尽得邸阁粮谷、战具。是岁兴平二年也。时彭城相薛礼、下邳相笮融，依繇为盟主；礼据秣陵城，融屯县南。策先攻融，融出兵交战；斩首五百余级，融即闭门，不敢动。因渡江攻礼，礼突走；而樊能、于麋等，复合众，袭夺牛渚屯。策闻之，还攻破能等，获男女万余人。复下攻融，为流矢所中，伤股；不能乘马，因自舆，还牛渚营。或叛告融曰：‘孙郎被箭，已死！’融大喜，即遣将于兹向策。策遣步骑数百挑战，设伏于后。贼出击之，锋刃未接而伪走；贼追入伏中，乃大破之，斩首千余级。策因往到融营下，令左右大呼曰：‘孙郎竟云何！’贼于是惊怖，夜遁。融闻策尚在，更深沟高垒，缮治守备。策以融所屯地势险固，乃舍去；攻破繇别将于海陵，转攻湖孰、江乘，皆下之。”","attribution":"《江表传》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":248,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-6fa39d8ee05c62716a11","start":0,"end":326,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-b-c63b764c8d77474949e4","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-c63b764c8d77474949e4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖11〗二年：兴平二年（公元 195）。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":38,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c70b78b19d5fc0e5d4ef","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-o009","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-867468e927405dc6280f","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏〖11〗，太祖军乘氏。大饥，人相食。","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":26,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yaoci-q-db4f64b5e1c7f56c6428","section":"chapter-049","block":"b-9c3ec449339241f9608c","layer":"original","quote":"繇遣樊能、张英，屯江边以拒之","section_title":"刘繇太史慈士燮传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0105.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhouyu-e-o003b-q","section":"chapter-054","block":"b-31b40d63d1cd4e25427e","layer":"original","quote":"遂从攻横江、当利，皆拔之。","section_title":"周瑜鲁肃吕蒙传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0115.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-404bf8a47a0d895284ae","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-03a8558afb4d94614edf","layer":"original","quote":"后从策攻破庐江。还，俱东渡；到横江、当利，破张英、于麋，下小丹杨、湖孰〖9〗，领湖孰相","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":43,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q2-f6fefa80b12e37da23b8","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-03a8558afb4d94614edf","layer":"original","quote":"还，俱东渡；到横江、当利，破张英、于麋","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":150,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":8,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
